{"id":"9dbb4ca7eb32ec76","group":"29","path":"29/29-lem-iteration-orbit.md","title":"有限关系状态的最终周期与稳定截断","display":"lem-iteration-orbit — 有限关系状态的最终周期与稳定截断","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-lem-iteration-orbit","aliases":["29-lem-iteration-orbit"],"display":"lem-iteration-orbit — 有限关系状态的最终周期与稳定截断","depends_on":["[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 10.9 discussion, p.160, DjVu scan 175; Definition 10.12, p.161, DjVu scan 176","source_basis":"已查看扫描图175–176；鸽巢与确定性递推的本地证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-lem-iteration-orbit"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-lem-iteration-orbit</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-iteration-orbit — 有限关系状态的最终周期与稳定截断"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f12f36e10770cfc\" href=\"?note=2f12f36e10770cfc\" title=\"29-df-simultaneous-iteration\">29-df-simultaneous-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 10.9 discussion, p.160, DjVu scan 175; Definition 10.12, p.161, DjVu scan 176"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"已查看扫描图175–176；鸽巢与确定性递推的本地证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=2^{m n^k}\">\\(N=2^{m n^k}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\">\\(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{A,\\mathcal I}\">\\(F_{A,\\mathcal I}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f12f36e10770cfc\" href=\"?note=2f12f36e10770cfc\" title=\"29-df-simultaneous-iteration\">29-df-simultaneous-iteration</a>；不假设更新公式正性或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{A,\\mathcal I}\">\\(F_{A,\\mathcal I}\\)</span> 单调。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left|\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\right|=N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left|\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\right|=N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\quad\\left(\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N\\ \\land\\ \\forall r\\geq\\mu\\;\\mathbf X_{r+\\lambda}^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\quad\\left(\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N\\ \\land\\ \\forall r\\geq\\mu\\;\\mathbf X_{r+\\lambda}^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\exists r&lt;N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\exists r&lt;N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\left(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\geq r\\;\\mathbf X_s^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\left(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\geq r\\;\\mathbf X_s^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷页160–161、扫描页175–176以有限状态数解释迭代必稳定或循环。这里显式计入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系，而不把一个关系的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^k}\">\\(2^{n^k}\\)</span> 状态数误用于整组关系。证明：在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf X_0,\\ldots,\\mathbf X_N\">\\(\\mathbf X_0,\\ldots,\\mathbf X_N\\)</span> 中取首次重复，设重复位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu&lt;\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N\">\\(\\mu&lt;\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N\\)</span>。确定性递推把该等式传播到所有后继阶段，因此此后周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>。若将来存在稳定阶段，则最早稳定状态之前不能已有不同阶段的重复，否则会落入不含该新稳定状态的循环；故最早稳定位置小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。最后一式直接对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s-r\">\\(s-r\\)</span> 归纳。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=1\">\\(m=1\\)</span>、空初态即得到 PFP 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^k}\">\\(2^{n^k}\\)</span> 以内检查相邻稳定的依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"2f12f36e10770cfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"2f12f36e10770cfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}$ 与 $F_{A,\\mathcal I}$ 见 [[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]；不假设更新公式正性或 $F_{A,\\mathcal I}$ 单调。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"N=2^{m n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}","display":false},{"tex":"F_{A,\\mathcal I}","display":false},{"tex":"F_{A,\\mathcal I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\left|\\mathcal P(|A|^k)^m\\right|=N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\quad\\left(\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N\\ \\land\\ \\forall r\\geq\\mu\\;\\mathbf X_{r+\\lambda}^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\exists r<N\\;\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall r\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\\left(\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_{r+1}^{A,\\mathcal I}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall s\\geq r\\;\\mathbf X_s^{A,\\mathcal I}=\\mathbf X_r^{A,\\mathcal I}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf X_0,\\ldots,\\mathbf X_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu<\\mu+\\lambda\\leq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"s-r","display":false},{"tex":"m=1","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^k}","display":false}],"bytes":2250,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-lem-ind-fo-iteration]]、[[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]、[[29-lem-iter-space]] — 块展开、有限轨道与空间上界"},{"id":"d0e294138a289a56","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 10.12，印刷页 161，扫描页 176。状态总数为 $2^{n^k}$；在此范围内没有相邻重复，则之后只能进入长度大于一的循环，按定义返回空关系。多于一个稳定阶段时所有稳定值相同。有限状态截断与最终周期的显式证明见 [[29-lem-iteration-orbit]]，取一个关系及空初态即可；本次同时查看了扫描页176的原始分段定义。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-iteration-orbit]]"}],"outgoing":["2f12f36e10770cfc"]}